  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "To Lady Yuna, daughter of Lord Daichi,\n\nAfter careful examination and
    deliberation, the investigation has reached its conclusion.\n\nLord Daichi is
    hereby declared innocent of all charges of treason. The evidence you provided
    has exposed a calculated plot against him, devised with malicious intent. Such
    dishonour shall not go unpunished\u2014those responsible will be held accountable
    under the full weight of the law.\n\nThe honour of House Daichi is restored by
    official decree. The stain upon your family\u2019s name has been lifted.\n\nYour
    resolve, discretion, and unwavering loyalty have been noted by this court. Few
    show such strength in the face of adversity. You have acted with wisdom and courage,
    not only as a daughter, but as a true servant of justice.\n\nMay your name and
    deeds be remembered with dignity.\n\nWith respect,\nShogun Tokugawa"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d691116db8b14525af5e89d41049aae, type: 2}
